  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development raises significant risk to the highway network as a result of the intensification of the use. It has not been evidenced that the site can handle the expected capacity, and the constrained nature of the site means it is likely that the site would present an adverse impact upon the highway network, and present an obstruction to the movement of pedestrians and cyclists. It has not been shown that the site can accommodate the two units or provide adequate off-street parking. The development would present an adverse impact to the highway and would be contrary to the following policies:National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024)Policies T1 and T6.1 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policy DMT2 of the Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September 2024)"
  ],
